    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Schizo Dark immerses you in a world of nightmarish dreams, where you are a detective investigating disappearances in your sleep. You will need to avoid monsters, conserve ammo, and find a way out of this cursed world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping survival horror with a terrifying atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival strategy: limited resources and the need to hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intriguing investigation and dark storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic monsters and frightening nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense atmosphere with elements of psychological horror.</p>",
